{
  "style": "风格三",
  "canvas_width": 691,
  "background": "#88a846",
  "background_pattern": "soft_diagonal",
  "background_pattern_color": "#7f9f3f",
  "body_size": 25,
  "section_label_size": 38,
  "framed_header_size": 30,
  "bubble_size": 18,
  "bottom_padding": 90,
  "blocks": [
    {"type": "paragraph", "text": "这个同事 Jane 在想：\n上班第一年的我，和上班第五年的我，\n差别到底在哪里？", "color": "#ffffff", "stroke_width": 3, "stroke_fill": "#222222", "pad_top": 46, "pad_bottom": 28},
    {"type": "image", "path": "panels/panel-01.png", "width": 610, "radius": 20, "speech_bubbles": [{"x": 40, "y": 34, "width": 210, "height": 70, "text": "明天要汇报，\n今晚再改一下吧"}]},
    {"type": "section_label", "text": "01 遇上内卷", "color": "#ffffff", "stroke_width": 3, "stroke_fill": "#1a1a1a"},
    {"type": "framed_image", "header": "上班第一年", "path": "panels/panel-02.png", "width": 610, "speech_bubbles": [{"x": 38, "y": 42, "width": 235, "height": 76, "text": "大家都没走，\n我怎么敢先走？"}, {"x": 350, "y": 64, "width": 210, "height": 76, "text": "提前走会不会\n显得不积极？"}]},
    {"type": "framed_image", "header": "上班第五年", "path": "panels/panel-03.png", "width": 610, "speech_bubbles": [{"x": 38, "y": 40, "width": 220, "height": 76, "text": "我先下班了，\n明早继续。"}, {"x": 350, "y": 70, "width": 205, "height": 70, "text": "这就走了？"}]},
    {"type": "section_label", "text": "摸清自己的身体极限\n守住适合自己的工作节奏，效率反而更高", "color": "#ffffff", "stroke_width": 3, "stroke_fill": "#1a1a1a", "font_size": 30},
    {"type": "section_label", "text": "02 遇上聚餐邀约", "color": "#ffffff", "stroke_width": 3, "stroke_fill": "#1a1a1a"},
    {"type": "framed_image", "header": "上班第一年", "path": "panels/panel-04.png", "width": 610, "speech_bubbles": [{"x": 310, "y": 34, "width": 245, "height": 86, "text": "Jane 今晚要不要\n一起吃个饭？"}, {"x": 110, "y": 245, "width": 160, "height": 62, "text": "好啊好啊！"}]},
    {"type": "framed_image", "header": "上班第五年", "path": "panels/panel-05.png", "width": 610, "speech_bubbles": [{"x": 34, "y": 44, "width": 255, "height": 86, "text": "今晚不去了，\n我想早点休息。"}, {"x": 350, "y": 54, "width": 190, "height": 70, "text": "收到，下次。"}]},
    {"type": "section_label", "text": "不临时邀约打断既定计划\n坚持自己的生活节奏，好让状态始终在线", "color": "#ffffff", "stroke_width": 3, "stroke_fill": "#1a1a1a", "font_size": 30}
  ]
}
